WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.812 --> 00:00:06.973
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> I think he’s Nadine’s hairdresser. He works inside, other people help him.

2
00:00:07.168 --> 00:00:12.413
<v><b>George:</b></v> But he doesn’t work at weekends. Hairdressers work on Saturdays.

3
00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:14.442
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Not all hairdressers.

4
00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:19.536
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> He isn’t a chef, I’m sure. Pubs are full at weekends.

5
00:00:19.777 --> 00:00:29.545
And James says he cooks British food, but his speciality is spaghetti carbonara. That’s Italian, not British!

6
00:00:29.665 --> 00:00:32.040
I think he’s a hairdresser, too.

7
00:00:32.235 --> 00:00:38.156
<v><b>George:</b></v> But Nadine says they’re friends, and then she says, ‘I don’t think he has children’.

8
00:00:38.231 --> 00:00:44.077
She doesn’t know. I think that’s strange. I think he’s Tyler’s dentist.

9
00:00:44.197 --> 00:00:52.358
He has special qualifications, and remember, ‘People don’t always like me’. Nobody likes dentists.

10
00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:54.446
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> We need to agree.

11
00:00:58.549 --> 00:01:01.480
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Your time’s up, Team B.

12
00:01:01.525 --> 00:01:04.215
So what’s Mike’s job?

13
00:01:04.605 --> 00:01:07.611
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> We think he’s a hairdresser.

14
00:01:07.821 --> 00:01:11.428
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Mike, what do you do?

15
00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.673
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> I’m Tyler’s dentist.

16
00:01:17.154 --> 00:01:21.978
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Yes, Mike is Tyler’s dentist.

17
00:01:22.233 --> 00:01:27.042
He says nobody likes dentists, but we like you, Mike!

18
00:01:27.207 --> 00:01:29.702
Thank you very much indeed.